  "solution": "BODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nGiven substitutions:\n\n \n \n\n **Original Symbol**\n **Replaced By**\n \n \n\n **+**\n **÷**\n \n \n\n **-**\n **+**\n \n \n\n **×**\n **-**\n \n \n\n **÷**\n **×**\n \n \n\n**\nChecking Option 1:\n\n324 + 18 - 9 × 3 = 30\n\nAfter replacing the symbols:\n\n⇒ 324 ÷ 18 + 9 - 3 = 30\n\n⇒ __**324 ÷ **____**18**__ + 9 - 3 = 30\n\n⇒ __**18 + 9**__ - 3 = 30\n\n⇒ __27 - 3__** = 30\n\n⇒** 24** ≠ 30\n\nChecking Option 2:\n\n121 − 11 × 5 + 6 = 120\n\nAfter replacing the symbols:\n\n⇒ 121 + 11 - 5 ÷ 6 = 120\n\n⇒ 121 + 11 - __**5 ÷ 6**__ = 120\n\n⇒ 121 + 11 - __**0.833**__ = 120\n\n⇒ __**121 + 11**__ - 0.833 = 120\n\n⇒ 132 - 0.833 = 120\n\n⇒ __**132 - 0.833**__ = 120\n\n⇒ __**131.167**__ ≠ 120\n\n**Checking Option 3:**\n\n100 ÷ 10 + 5 − 2 = 202\n\nAfter replacing the symbols:\n\n⇒ 100 × 10 ÷ 5 + 2 = 202\n\n⇒ 100 × __**10 ÷ 5**__ + 2 = 202\n\n⇒ __**100 × 2**__ + 2 = 202\n\n⇒ **__200 + 2__ **= 202\n\n**⇒ __202__ = 202**\n\nChecking Option 4:\n\n225 − 15 + 10 × 2 = 260\n\nAfter replacing the symbols:\n\n⇒ 225 + 15 ÷ 10 - 2 = 260\n\n⇒ 225 + __15 ÷ 10__ - 2 = 260\n\n⇒ 225 + __1.5__ - 2 = 260\n\n⇒ __225 + 1.5__ - 2 = 260\n\n⇒ 226.5 - 2 = 260\n\n⇒ __226.5 - 2__ = 260\n\n⇒ __224.5__ ≠ 260\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
